This repository holds the source of the Silicon From Scratch website,
published at https://siliconfromscratch.com. It is public so that the site
can be served from it and so that its construction can be read. It is not
open source.

No part of it may be copied, modified, republished, mirrored, redistributed,
used to train a model, or used as the basis of another site, course or
product without written permission from the author. That covers the HTML,
CSS and JavaScript; the lessons, quizzes and all other prose; the figures,
diagrams, die images and photographs; the video and audio; the Verilog shown
in the lessons; and the tooling under tools/ and meet-the-processor/verify/.

